# Settings > Updates (report 047 P1), a release build 0.8.12 (arm64): the root row after Apps, then the page in its
# states. The fake check (harness_update.cpp) answers from projects/APPLaunch/tests/fixtures/update:
#   1. checking: the page starts a check as it opens; the answer is held back (Check now's dot blue, the status line)
#   2. available: GitHub's list with 0.8.13 on top of the real 0.8.9-0.8.12 (a draft 0.8.15 and a pre-release
#      0.8.14-rc.1 above it are ignored): "0.8.13 available" in amber; the Launcher level (What's new in 0.8.13, Check
#      again, the versions in the status line); What's new (one version: its notes up to the marker)
#   3. the Settings root: the Updates row's value in amber, a chevron
#   4. offline: no default route; the last result stays shown
#   5. rate-limited: GitHub's 403 with X-RateLimit-Remaining 0: the reset time (21:00 UTC)
# Keys only here (touch: updates_dev). Review only: no golden; the headers are checked against the home grid's.
title updates page
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
# P3: no Store backend here: the "App updates" row (a thread that reads the catalogue) stays out of this scene, so a shot
# never depends on when that thread ends; the System packages scan is held (apt board pending): its row says "checking"
env HARNESS_APPS missing
apt board pending
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-10-31
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.8.12 release arm64
update answer pending
home
header home
launch Settings
wait 300
expect_rows Screen Wi-Fi Bluetooth Launcher Touch Apps Updates User "Date & Time" System
# root: Up from Screen wraps to System, Date & Time, User, Updates
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
shot updates_root_never
key ENTER
wait 300
# 1. checking
shot updates_checking
header updates_checking "Settings > Updates" Updates
expect_text start "Checking for updates..."
# 2. the answer: 0.8.13 offered
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
wait 1000
shot updates_available
expect_text "0.8.13 available"
expect_color "0.8.13 available" F0B400
expect_text "today 20:30"
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_launcher
header updates_launcher "Settings > Updates > Launcher" "Updates > Launcher" Launcher
expect_text "What's new in 0.8.13"
expect_text "0.8.12 -> 0.8.13, release, arm64"
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_whatsnew_one
header updates_whatsnew_one "Settings > Updates > Launcher > What's new" "Updates > Launcher > What's new" "Launcher > What's new" "What's new"
# 3. back to the Settings root: the row's value
key ESC
key ESC
key ESC
wait 300
shot updates_settings_root
expect_text "0.8.13 available"
expect_color "0.8.13 available" F0B400
# 4. offline
update net off
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot updates_offline
expect_text "No network: the last result is shown"
expect_text "0.8.13 available"
key ESC
# 5. GitHub's rate limit
update net on
update answer ratelimit
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot updates_ratelimited
expect_text "GitHub's limit reached: try again after 21:00"
